== 4号线 ==
{{main|上海轨道交通4号线}}
{{multiple image|align=right|direction=vertical|width=180
|image1=Yishan Road Station Line 4.jpg|caption1=宜山路站
|image2=Dalian Road Station.jpg|caption2=大连路站
|image3=Century Avenue Station Line 4 Platform 2016.jpg|caption3=世纪大道站
|image4=Luban Road Station.jpg|caption4=鲁班路站
